1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:02,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ suspenseful music playing]</b></font>

3
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:38,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps receding]</b></font>

4
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] I'm sorry.</b></font>

5
00:02:02,710 --> 00:02:04,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[squelching]
-Itadori.</b></font>

6
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Sukuna scoffs]</b></font>

7
00:02:14,380 --> 00:02:16,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ dramatic music playing]</b></font>

8
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

9
00:02:22,230 --> 00:02:25,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

10
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:28,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans, grunts]</b></font>

11
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:30,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

12
00:02:37,370 --> 00:02:38,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[scoffs]</b></font>

13
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] He's fast.</b></font>

14
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:45,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't figure out
the trick to his technique.</b></font>

15
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:47,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With him
overwhelmingly me this badly,</b></font>

16
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:49,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he's not likely to
reveal his hand.</b></font>

17
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:52,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have no chance
to use Convergence.</b></font>

18
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:56,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>None of my external
Blood Manipulation is usable.</b></font>

19
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're persistent.</b></font>

20
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:09,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seriously, though, what are you?</b></font>

21
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>An older brother
with nine younger siblings.</b></font>

22
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:17,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Flowing Red Scale - Stack!</b></font>

23
00:03:17,110 --> 00:03:19,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Good to know,
but that's not what I asked.</b></font>

24
00:03:19,910 --> 00:03:21,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna know
why you're so tough,</b></font>

25
00:03:22,370 --> 00:03:24,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and about that technique
of yours. [grunts]</b></font>

26
00:03:31,170 --> 00:03:32,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whooshes]</b></font>

27
00:03:42,430 --> 00:03:44,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's starting to match me.</b></font>

28
00:03:46,270 --> 00:03:47,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

29
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Choso gasps]</b></font>

30
00:03:52,070 --> 00:03:53,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] I see what he's up to.</b></font>

31
00:03:53,940 --> 00:03:55,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Flowing Red Scale, huh?</b></font>

32
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's focusing that power
on his external eye muscles</b></font>

33
00:03:58,820 --> 00:04:00,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to improve his kinetic vision.</b></font>

34
00:04:01,910 --> 00:04:03,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can't beat me.</b></font>

35
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:07,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can counter your moves before
you even know you'll make them.</b></font>

36
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Since you're so persistent,</b></font>

37
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:10,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I went ahead and used my weapon.</b></font>

38
00:04:10,500 --> 00:04:12,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't worry.</b></font>

39
00:04:12,170 --> 00:04:14,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can easily stop the bleeding
with your Blood Manipulation.</b></font>

40
00:04:15,380 --> 00:04:17,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But let's find out
how well you do fighting me</b></font>

41
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and staunching your blood
at the same time.</b></font>

42
00:04:20,010 --> 00:04:21,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] You came
prepared with a sword.</b></font>

43
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Keep it a secret,
will ya?</b></font>

44
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Honestly, I think it's lame,</b></font>

45
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:27,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a sorcerer walking around
with a weapon?</b></font>

46
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:29,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Feels strange if
you can't win without it.</b></font>

47
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But a surprising number
of people think this way.</b></font>

48
00:04:31,810 --> 00:04:32,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not just me.</b></font>

49
00:04:33,610 --> 00:04:35,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, I think
my older brothers are pathetic</b></font>

50
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:37,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for carrying them,</b></font>

51
00:04:37,190 --> 00:04:38,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and yet they think
they have some kind of right</b></font>

52
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:40,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to complain about Toji.</b></font>

53
00:04:40,610 --> 00:04:41,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You hate them, don't you?</b></font>

54
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:43,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your older brothers?</b></font>

55
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:44,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I do hate them.</b></font>

56
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:47,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Older brothers less competent
than younger brothers</b></font>

57
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>serve no purpose.</b></font>

58
00:04:48,410 --> 00:04:50,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Actually, I think they
deserve to be hanged.</b></font>

59
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should have gratitude
towards them.</b></font>

60
00:04:53,460 --> 00:04:56,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your older brothers have
shaped who you are today.</b></font>

61
00:04:56,460 --> 00:04:57,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ugh.</b></font>

62
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:01,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That is the most disgusting
thing I have ever heard.</b></font>

63
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:02,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please don't gross me out.</b></font>

64
00:05:03,970 --> 00:05:06,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whether or not
older brothers are competent,</b></font>

65
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:08,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they set an example
for their younger brothers.</b></font>

66
00:05:09,020 --> 00:05:11,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I make mistakes
and go down the wrong path,</b></font>

67
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then my little brothers
can avoid that path.</b></font>

68
00:05:13,900 --> 00:05:15,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And if I go down
the proper path,</b></font>

69
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:18,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then my little brothers
can follow after me.</b></font>

70
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What would you do</b></font>

71
00:05:20,450 --> 00:05:23,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you were strong because
your older brothers proved weak?</b></font>

72
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:26,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-You asked me why I'm tough?
-Hmm?</b></font>

73
00:05:26,790 --> 00:05:27,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] I'll tell you.</b></font>

74
00:05:28,370 --> 00:05:29,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never had an example.</b></font>

75
00:05:29,910 --> 00:05:32,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I had to make many,
many mistakes.</b></font>

76
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:33,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And yet,</b></font>

77
00:05:33,790 --> 00:05:36,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I kept walking in front
of my younger brothers.</b></font>

78
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:38,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And that made me strong!</b></font>

79
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:39,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ dramatic music playing]</b></font>

80
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA]
What's he going on about?</b></font>

81
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:47,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And how is he still alive
after bleeding so much?</b></font>

82
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:58,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] The Death Paintings
are a mix of curse and human.</b></font>

83
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:00,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They possess the unique ability</b></font>

84
00:06:00,070 --> 00:06:02,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to convert
cursed energy into blood.</b></font>

85
00:06:02,650 --> 00:06:05,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Until their cursed energy
dries up,</b></font>

86
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:07,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they cannot die
from blood loss.</b></font>

87
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

88
00:06:31,850 --> 00:06:33,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[light switch thudding]</b></font>

89
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:35,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Why are my legs heavy?</b></font>

90
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did he harden the blood</b></font>

91
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:39,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that seeped into
the fabric of my shoes?</b></font>

92
00:06:39,610 --> 00:06:41,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] Do you understand now?</b></font>

93
00:06:42,570 --> 00:06:44,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is checkmate.</b></font>

94
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:52,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't congratulate yourself yet.</b></font>

95
00:06:53,330 --> 00:06:55,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My technique traces
my opponent's future motions</b></font>

96
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at 24 frames per second.</b></font>

97
00:06:58,340 --> 00:07:00,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is only a minor hindrance.</b></font>

98
00:07:00,210 --> 00:07:01,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can still move.</b></font>

99
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He missed his chance.</b></font>

100
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:09,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why isn't he
striking out against me?</b></font>

101
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:12,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Developed after
grappling with his technique</b></font>

102
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:14,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for over 150 years,</b></font>

103
00:07:14,810 --> 00:07:16,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this was a Choso original.</b></font>

104
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[explosions]</b></font>

105
00:07:18,690 --> 00:07:19,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

106
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Naoya gasping]</b></font>

107
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:32,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[choking, breathing raggedly]</b></font>

108
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry,</b></font>

109
00:07:44,380 --> 00:07:47,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I can't understand how
you never loved your brothers.</b></font>

110
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps approaching]</b></font>

111
00:07:57,810 --> 00:07:58,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

112
00:08:02,770 --> 00:08:04,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-[punches]</b></font>

113
00:08:09,910 --> 00:08:11,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] That looks painful.</b></font>

114
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Naoya.</b></font>

115
00:08:16,790 --> 00:08:18,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[hisses]</b></font>

116
00:08:18,580 --> 00:08:20,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] Don't look down on me.</b></font>

117
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:21,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

118
00:08:21,580 --> 00:08:25,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[choking, retching]</b></font>

119
00:08:27,420 --> 00:08:29,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NAOYA] What is this? Poison?</b></font>

120
00:08:29,340 --> 00:08:30,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groaning]</b></font>

121
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Blood Manipulation
shouldn't be capable of...</b></font>

122
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:35,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, it's not
a product of his technique.</b></font>

123
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:40,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He had that much blood
because he's not human!</b></font>

124
00:08:40,190 --> 00:08:41,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could it be an incarnation?</b></font>

125
00:08:42,270 --> 00:08:44,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is his inhuman blood
in my body being rejected?</b></font>

126
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:46,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] Shall I heal you?</b></font>

127
00:08:47,490 --> 00:08:49,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have reverse cursed technique.</b></font>

128
00:08:49,610 --> 00:08:51,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It can heal people.</b></font>

129
00:08:51,570 --> 00:08:53,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And then in return,</b></font>

130
00:08:53,530 --> 00:08:55,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>could you please
report Itadori's death</b></font>

131
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:58,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the top brass,
as per our arrangement?</b></font>

132
00:09:01,500 --> 00:09:03,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI'S GRANDFATHER]
Jin! [echoing]</b></font>

133
00:09:09,170 --> 00:09:10,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, Father. What is it?</b></font>

134
00:09:11,220 --> 00:09:12,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if you wanna
talk about her again,</b></font>

135
00:09:12,930 --> 00:09:14,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then I'm going home.</b></font>

136
00:09:14,850 --> 00:09:17,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look, Jin,
you're free to live your life</b></font>

137
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:19,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>whichever way you choose.</b></font>

138
00:09:20,140 --> 00:09:23,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, you have to
stay away from that woman,</b></font>

139
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or you'll die!</b></font>

140
00:09:25,690 --> 00:09:27,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please stop saying
such terrible things</b></font>

141
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:29,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in front of Yuji, Father.</b></font>

142
00:09:29,570 --> 00:09:32,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'd be surprised at how much
a baby can remember.</b></font>

143
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:34,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know that the most
important thing for you</b></font>

144
00:09:34,780 --> 00:09:35,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was to have a child.</b></font>

145
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:37,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I'm sorry
that you were never able</b></font>

146
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:39,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to do that with Kaori.</b></font>

147
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:42,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But, son, Kaori died
and you know I'm-- [gasps]</b></font>

148
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:44,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, Father,</b></font>

149
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why would you say that?</b></font>

150
00:09:47,090 --> 00:09:49,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[fire crackling]</b></font>

151
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

152
00:09:58,470 --> 00:09:59,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

153
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:01,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm alive. But how?</b></font>

154
00:10:18,700 --> 00:10:20,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta sighs]</b></font>

155
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:23,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, thank goodness! [laughs]</b></font>

156
00:10:24,370 --> 00:10:25,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

157
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckling]</b></font>

158
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:29,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

159
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:32,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was September, I think.</b></font>

160
00:10:32,970 --> 00:10:35,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Satoru Gojo went out of his way
to see me.</b></font>

161
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:38,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He asked me
to always watch after you.</b></font>

162
00:10:38,850 --> 00:10:41,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles] So I had no choice</b></font>

163
00:10:41,310 --> 00:10:43,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but to put on that act.</b></font>

164
00:10:43,180 --> 00:10:44,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You were acting?</b></font>

165
00:10:45,100 --> 00:10:48,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] I've got
a bit of a bad feeling.</b></font>

166
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If anything happens to me,</b></font>

167
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:51,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want you
to take care of the first</b></font>

168
00:10:51,530 --> 00:10:52,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and second-year students.</b></font>

169
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:55,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Except for Hakari.
He'll be fine.</b></font>

170
00:10:56,410 --> 00:10:57,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If anything happens?</b></font>

171
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You in trouble with a woman?</b></font>

172
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:02,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] I'm glad to see
you've developed</b></font>

173
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a sense of humor, Yuta.</b></font>

174
00:11:03,830 --> 00:11:05,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuta chuckles] No, I'm serious.</b></font>

175
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:09,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just can't imagine
anything happening to you, Gojo.</b></font>

176
00:11:09,210 --> 00:11:10,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SATORU] Well, just in case,</b></font>

177
00:11:10,710 --> 00:11:12,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>take special care
of Yuji Itadori.</b></font>

178
00:11:12,710 --> 00:11:15,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's been sentenced to
secret execution, like you were.</b></font>

179
00:11:15,550 --> 00:11:18,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It would be a big help to me
if you looked out for him.</b></font>

180
00:11:19,510 --> 00:11:21,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, by the way, how's Miguel?</b></font>

181
00:11:21,430 --> 00:11:23,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He said he didn't wanna see you.</b></font>

182
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:24,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Eh?</b></font>

183
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:27,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA]
This act was the best option</b></font>

184
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:30,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to prevent someone else
from being sent to execute you.</b></font>

185
00:11:30,730 --> 00:11:33,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And to cut off any information
about you to others as well.</b></font>

186
00:11:34,530 --> 00:11:36,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then again,
they're not idiots either.</b></font>

187
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So before they would
approve me as the executioner,</b></font>

188
00:11:40,030 --> 00:11:43,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>headquarters made me forge
a pact to make sure I did it.</b></font>

189
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:46,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's the reason I actually
had to kill you for a moment.</b></font>

190
00:11:46,910 --> 00:11:48,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm real sorry about that.</b></font>

191
00:11:49,250 --> 00:11:53,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait. If you killed me,
then how am I still alive?</b></font>

192
00:11:53,710 --> 00:11:55,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reverse cursed technique.</b></font>

193
00:11:56,090 --> 00:11:57,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I used my reverse
cursed technique</b></font>

194
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:00,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the moment your heart stopped
to immediately heal you.</b></font>

195
00:12:01,180 --> 00:12:02,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I figured it would work,</b></font>

196
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:04,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>based upon all the things
I've heard about you before.</b></font>

197
00:12:04,850 --> 00:12:06,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess I was right.</b></font>

198
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:08,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There aren't
too many people around</b></font>

199
00:12:08,190 --> 00:12:12,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who know that I'm capable
of outputting positive energy.</b></font>

200
00:12:12,230 --> 00:12:15,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the second time
you faked your death.</b></font>

201
00:12:15,570 --> 00:12:17,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're bound to figure it out.</b></font>

202
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:19,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But the situation's
still chaotic.</b></font>

203
00:12:19,660 --> 00:12:21,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're going to believe
you're dead,</b></font>

204
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for a while at least.</b></font>

205
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:23,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Headquarters will think</b></font>

206
00:12:23,950 --> 00:12:26,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>your death sentence
was carried out.</b></font>

207
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:30,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why go this far?</b></font>

208
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's in it for you?</b></font>

209
00:12:31,830 --> 00:12:34,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm doing it because
the people that I cherish</b></font>

210
00:12:35,260 --> 00:12:37,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>also happen to be
people who cherish you.</b></font>

211
00:12:39,930 --> 00:12:41,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The power I shoulder,</b></font>

212
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:44,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I used to think it was greater
than I could bear.</b></font>

213
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:48,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At first, I'd thought the power
had been forced upon me,</b></font>

214
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:51,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but it was really something
that I'd brought upon myself.</b></font>

215
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:55,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not like you. The power
you shoulder isn't yours.</b></font>

216
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:00,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not your fault.</b></font>

217
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's not true.</b></font>

218
00:13:07,290 --> 00:13:08,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't get it.</b></font>

219
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:10,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It isn't a matter of
who's to blame or not.</b></font>

220
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:11,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I killed them.</b></font>

221
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:13,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-It was me--
-[MEGUMI] Itadori.</b></font>

222
00:13:13,500 --> 00:13:14,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

223
00:13:18,210 --> 00:13:20,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps] Fushiguro,
what are you doing here?</b></font>

224
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're going back
to Jujutsu High.</b></font>

225
00:13:23,090 --> 00:13:25,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The barrier surrounding
the school has been weakened.</b></font>

226
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:28,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It should be safe
for you to return there again.</b></font>

227
00:13:28,060 --> 00:13:29,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So long as no one
sees your face.</b></font>

228
00:13:30,270 --> 00:13:31,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll meet up with
the upperclassmen and then--</b></font>

229
00:13:31,850 --> 00:13:32,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stop it!</b></font>

230
00:13:33,610 --> 00:13:37,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't talk about it like
it's just another normal day.</b></font>

231
00:13:37,730 --> 00:13:39,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't just pretend
it didn't happen.</b></font>

232
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:42,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I killed people.</b></font>

233
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A lot of people.</b></font>

234
00:13:45,950 --> 00:13:47,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's because of me
that so many are dead now!</b></font>

235
00:13:47,990 --> 00:13:49,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Because of us!</b></font>

236
00:13:50,540 --> 00:13:52,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Of course
you would say that.</b></font>

237
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] You can't give up</b></font>

238
00:13:55,250 --> 00:13:56,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>just because you want to.</b></font>

239
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:05,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

240
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:11,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We aren't heroes.</b></font>

241
00:14:12,390 --> 00:14:13,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're jujutsu sorcerers.</b></font>

242
00:14:14,690 --> 00:14:17,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no one who can
judge us unless they've been us.</b></font>

243
00:14:17,860 --> 00:14:19,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's all the more reason</b></font>

244
00:14:20,070 --> 00:14:22,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why we have to
keep proving why we exist.</b></font>

245
00:14:24,780 --> 00:14:26,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] You're wrong, Fushiguro.</b></font>

246
00:14:26,780 --> 00:14:28,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We don't have time
to worry about ourselves</b></font>

247
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:30,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and our feelings anymore.</b></font>

248
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:33,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUJI] Don't say that or...
-We exist to save others.</b></font>

249
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:35,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]
...you'll end up suffering...</b></font>

250
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:37,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought saving people
was your driving motivation.</b></font>

251
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:39,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]...the whole time
you stay around me.</b></font>

252
00:14:39,250 --> 00:14:41,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Start by saving me, Itadori.</b></font>

253
00:14:45,050 --> 00:14:46,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

254
00:14:46,140 --> 00:14:48,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Noritoshi Kamo has
set up a death game</b></font>

255
00:14:48,470 --> 00:14:51,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>between those he granted
cursed techniques.</b></font>

256
00:14:51,310 --> 00:14:52,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Culling Game.</b></font>

257
00:14:52,310 --> 00:14:53,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ sentimental music playing]</b></font>

258
00:14:55,140 --> 00:14:57,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tsumiki has been drawn
into this game, too.</b></font>

259
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:00,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori...</b></font>

260
00:15:01,190 --> 00:15:02,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>please.</b></font>

261
00:15:07,950 --> 00:15:09,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need your power.</b></font>

262
00:15:50,070 --> 00:15:51,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okkotsu, I need your help.</b></font>

263
00:15:52,410 --> 00:15:55,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sukuna's plotting something
that uses Fushiguro.</b></font>

264
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He was able
to take over my body in Shibuya</b></font>

265
00:15:58,540 --> 00:16:01,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after I was forced
to eat 10 fingers at once.</b></font>

266
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:04,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's now a total
of 15 fingers inside of me.</b></font>

267
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:07,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if I'm fed
the remaining five all at once,</b></font>

268
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:09,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think he'll be able
to take me over again.</b></font>

269
00:16:10,010 --> 00:16:11,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if he does,</b></font>

270
00:16:11,550 --> 00:16:14,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if Sukuna appears
and takes control of me again,</b></font>

271
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:16,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need you to kill me.</b></font>

272
00:16:16,770 --> 00:16:18,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can I trust you
to do that for me?</b></font>

273
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:21,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, of course.</b></font>

274
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:24,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I promise I'll do it.</b></font>

275
00:16:24,690 --> 00:16:25,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, Fushiguro.</b></font>

276
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What do you need me to do?</b></font>

277
00:16:28,700 --> 00:16:30,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First, we go back
to Jujutsu High</b></font>

278
00:16:30,660 --> 00:16:32,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and then make
contact with Tengen.</b></font>

279
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:37,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How can we release
the seal of the Prison Realm?</b></font>

280
00:16:38,250 --> 00:16:40,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What is Noritoshi Kamo's
actual goal?</b></font>

281
00:16:40,710 --> 00:16:42,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And what moves will he make?</b></font>

282
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Culling Game
is an unprecedented act</b></font>

283
00:16:44,630 --> 00:16:46,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of jujutsu terrorism,</b></font>

284
00:16:46,300 --> 00:16:47,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and we need answers
to those questions</b></font>

285
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:49,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to resolve this situation.</b></font>

286
00:16:49,930 --> 00:16:51,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think the Tengen
might be the only one</b></font>

287
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:53,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>capable of answering them.</b></font>

288
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:55,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] What about that woman?</b></font>

289
00:16:55,260 --> 00:16:56,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maybe Tsukumo knows.</b></font>

290
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:59,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
I've already spoken to Tsukumo.</b></font>

291
00:16:59,390 --> 00:17:01,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In fact,
this whole thing was her plan.</b></font>

292
00:17:01,810 --> 00:17:04,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's also hiding away
at Jujutsu High.</b></font>

293
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:07,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hiding away from what?</b></font>

294
00:17:08,570 --> 00:17:10,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apparently, she doesn't
wanna deal with the higher-ups.</b></font>

295
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:14,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, the problem is
Tengen's concealment barriers.</b></font>

296
00:17:15,700 --> 00:17:17,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Within the barriers,</b></font>

297
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:19,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there are a thousand
constantly shuffling doors.</b></font>

298
00:17:19,910 --> 00:17:22,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Only one leads to
the Tombs of the Star</b></font>

299
00:17:22,670 --> 00:17:24,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where Tengen resides.</b></font>

300
00:17:25,380 --> 00:17:27,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] So unless
we pick the right door,</b></font>

301
00:17:27,760 --> 00:17:29,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we can't meet with Tengen?</b></font>

302
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:36,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry, Fushiguro, but...</b></font>

303
00:17:45,230 --> 00:17:46,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need to ask you something.</b></font>

304
00:17:50,860 --> 00:17:52,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What happened to Kugisaki?</b></font>

305
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:01,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I see.</b></font>

306
00:18:04,420 --> 00:18:05,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right.</b></font>

307
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:06,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sobs]</b></font>

308
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:15,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right, I... I understand.</b></font>

309
00:18:16,430 --> 00:18:18,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, about
the concealment barriers.</b></font>

310
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:20,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have a good workaround
for that.</b></font>

311
00:18:21,020 --> 00:18:23,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] How long
has he been listening?</b></font>

312
00:18:25,310 --> 00:18:27,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's the workaround? Tell us.</b></font>

313
00:18:27,820 --> 00:18:30,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You remember when
Mahito stole Sukuna's fingers</b></font>

314
00:18:30,570 --> 00:18:32,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the Death Paintings?</b></font>

315
00:18:32,740 --> 00:18:34,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're going to do
the same thing.</b></font>

316
00:18:40,950 --> 00:18:43,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter on TV]</b></font>

317
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:46,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, it hasn't been that long
since the last time, huh?</b></font>

318
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:48,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maki, what a surprise.</b></font>

319
00:18:49,590 --> 00:18:50,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, hello.</b></font>

320
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:54,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Maki! Is it safe
for you to be up?</b></font>

321
00:18:54,590 --> 00:18:57,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, it's not a problem.</b></font>

322
00:18:57,050 --> 00:18:59,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not much I could do
about the burns.</b></font>

323
00:18:59,220 --> 00:19:01,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reverse cursed technique
can't erase scars.</b></font>

324
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:03,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have to say,
your Heavenly Pact</b></font>

325
00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:05,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of physical prowess
is impressive.</b></font>

326
00:19:05,650 --> 00:19:07,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You saved your life
with the strength</b></font>

327
00:19:07,270 --> 00:19:08,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of your body's endurance.</b></font>

328
00:19:08,650 --> 00:19:10,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You didn't put faith
in your resistance</b></font>

329
00:19:10,610 --> 00:19:11,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to curses alone.</b></font>

330
00:19:11,990 --> 00:19:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a shame
the clan head didn't make it.</b></font>

331
00:19:14,110 --> 00:19:16,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAKI] It's not like it was
a competition or something.</b></font>

332
00:19:18,070 --> 00:19:20,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Megumi, how's it going
with Tengen's barrier?</b></font>

333
00:19:22,290 --> 00:19:23,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, you see--</b></font>

334
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:25,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let me explain.</b></font>

335
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:27,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>On the way
to the Tombs of the Star</b></font>

336
00:19:27,330 --> 00:19:28,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is the forbidden vault.</b></font>

337
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:31,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Inside that vault are
Jujutsu High's cursed tools</b></font>

338
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:32,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and cursed objects.</b></font>

339
00:19:32,960 --> 00:19:34,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus, the remains
of my brothers.</b></font>

340
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:41,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Noranso, Sho-oso, Tanso,
Sanso, Kotsuso, and Shoso.</b></font>

341
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:43,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even though
it's just their remains,</b></font>

342
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:44,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should be able
to sense their presence</b></font>

343
00:19:44,730 --> 00:19:46,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>using the side effect
of my technique.</b></font>

344
00:19:48,600 --> 00:19:49,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good for you!</b></font>

345
00:19:50,190 --> 00:19:51,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's really great to hear.</b></font>

346
00:19:52,030 --> 00:19:53,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But who are you?</b></font>

347
00:19:56,950 --> 00:19:58,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, for now...</b></font>

348
00:19:59,450 --> 00:20:01,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess you can call him
my older brother.</b></font>

349
00:20:01,830 --> 00:20:05,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[yelling emotionally] Yuji!</b></font>

350
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:06,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Let's go.</b></font>

351
00:20:09,170 --> 00:20:10,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] That's the one.</b></font>

352
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:12,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm certain of it.</b></font>

353
00:20:12,050 --> 00:20:15,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My younger brothers are
resting right beyond this door.</b></font>

354
00:20:15,210 --> 00:20:16,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm opening it.</b></font>

355
00:20:26,890 --> 00:20:28,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] Let's head down.</b></font>

356
00:20:29,810 --> 00:20:31,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Further in, there's an elevator</b></font>

357
00:20:31,270 --> 00:20:33,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>leading to
the Tombs of the Star.</b></font>

358
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:35,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Choso.</b></font>

359
00:20:36,530 --> 00:20:38,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] Coming.</b></font>

360
00:20:38,490 --> 00:20:40,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll come back for you later.</b></font>

361
00:20:40,490 --> 00:20:42,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hang in there a little longer.</b></font>

362
00:20:43,700 --> 00:20:45,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[mechanical whirring]</b></font>

363
00:20:45,580 --> 00:20:47,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door opens]</b></font>

364
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:50,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Bloodstains?</b></font>

365
00:20:50,170 --> 00:20:51,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder what happened.</b></font>

366
00:20:51,630 --> 00:20:53,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] It was 12 years ago.</b></font>

367
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:55,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thinking back on it now,</b></font>

368
00:20:55,170 --> 00:20:57,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that's when
all the distortions started.</b></font>

369
00:20:57,460 --> 00:21:00,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Can't just be
a coincidence, can it?</b></font>

370
00:21:00,970 --> 00:21:03,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right, everyone,
the main hall is just up ahead.</b></font>

371
00:21:17,900 --> 00:21:18,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

372
00:21:18,900 --> 00:21:20,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] There's nothing here.</b></font>

373
00:21:20,570 --> 00:21:22,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the main hall?</b></font>

374
00:21:22,490 --> 00:21:25,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] No,
he's declining to speak with us.</b></font>

375
00:21:25,530 --> 00:21:28,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tengen won't interfere
with reality.</b></font>

376
00:21:28,200 --> 00:21:30,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought if there was
ever a chance to reach him,</b></font>

377
00:21:30,500 --> 00:21:31,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it would be now,</b></font>

378
00:21:31,620 --> 00:21:33,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>while the Six Eyes
are sealed away.</b></font>

379
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:35,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was obviously naive.</b></font>

380
00:21:37,050 --> 00:21:39,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not all of us
being rejected,</b></font>

381
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but just me?</b></font>

382
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:46,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should head back.</b></font>

383
00:21:46,430 --> 00:21:48,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Tsumiki doesn't
have time to spare.</b></font>

384
00:21:50,730 --> 00:21:52,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] Leaving so soon?</b></font>

385
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:56,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's nice to meet you,
Child of Zen'in.</b></font>

386
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:58,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Descendant of Michizane,</b></font>

387
00:21:58,360 --> 00:22:00,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Cursed Womb Death Painting,</b></font>

388
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and at last...</b></font>

389
00:22:03,530 --> 00:22:05,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's the Vessel of Sukuna.</b></font>

390
00:22:10,330 --> 00:22:12,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

391
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:41,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN]
I must impose one condition.</b></font>

392
00:23:41,840 --> 00:23:43,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUTA] We came here to learn
how to open the Prison Realm.</b></font>

393
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:44,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUKI] No greeting for me?</b></font>

394
00:23:45,010 --> 00:23:46,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
Then why is this Culling Game?</b></font>

395
00:23:46,590 --> 00:23:48,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] To force
the evolution of mankind.</b></font>

396
00:23:48,430 --> 00:23:49,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHOKO] It's better
for the rules if being stripped</b></font>

397
00:23:50,010 --> 00:23:51,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>means death, too.</b></font>

398
00:23:51,140 --> 00:23:52,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] If Sukuna
takes control again,</b></font>

399
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:53,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>don't hesitate to kill me.</b></font>

400
00:23:53,310 --> 00:23:54,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CHOSO] Don't die out there.</b></font>

